  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1129776/description_810aff1d-be52-4160-bcc0-0652b4e5b84a.png\" alt=\"Whimscape x Cobblemon\"></p><p>將 Whimscape 風格帶入你的 Cobblemon 世界。</p><p>此資源包為所有方塊、物品新增紋理、全新3D模型，以及一些<strong>擁有獨特形態的寶可夢</strong>，同時保留其標誌性視覺效果。</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">已更新至 Cobblemon 1.7：啟程！</span><br></strong></p><p><strong>聲明：</strong><br>目前我不打算更動任何<strong>精靈球</strong>的設計，或許只會為它們加上外框以更好地融入整體風格（如同我對樹果所做的調整），因為它們的經典造型實在不宜隨意改動。</p><h3><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1129776/description_07c84e11-f3e4-4013-ba55-8e67196d46a4.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h3><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/whimscape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b33a6370-8d91-4340-b92a-d381b6a60ec9.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/whimscape-exploration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3d8a39b723eb011bd4fa8deee6880702f7d7e7b3.png\" alt=\"Cobblemon 附加元件\"></a></p>",
